<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.60 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.60 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Wednesday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on June 17 was 10.60 percent and the rate works out to 0.000310064 rupees.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari Pioneer's other mutual funds.. -------</p>
<p>    Name of Fund				NAV(Rs.per share)</p>
<p>    ------------				-----------------</p>
<p>    Prima fund					 10.04</p>
<p>    Prima plus					  7.30</p>
<p>    Bluechip fund				    13.09</p>
<p>    Taxshield	95				 7.77</p>
<p>			 96				11.80</p>
<p>			 97				  --</p>
<p>    Pension plan				     10.25</p>
<p>    Guaranted Income Plan - Annual	     10.77</p>
<p>				    Monthly	    10.40</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
